<title>FINLAND: PARTEK COMPLETES SISU DEAL, LISTS OWNERS.</title>
<headline>PARTEK COMPLETES SISU DEAL, LISTS OWNERS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cargo handling</p>
<p>equipment and building materials group Partek Oy said on Tuesday</p>
<p>it had completed the purchase of a majority stake in state-owned</p>
<p>Sisu Oy announced in January.</p>
<p>In a statement, Partek listed changes in its main owners as</p>
<p>follows:</p>
<p>						   Pct Now    Pct Previous</p>
<p>    State of Finland			   30.4	    -</p>
<p>    Valmet					 10.5	    -</p>
<p>    Aker					     -	    26</p>
<p>    Foundation Abo Akademi		    8.6	   10.8</p>
<p>    Sampo					   7.6	   n/a</p>
<p>    Elake-Varma				   4.3	   n/a</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
